&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hey there! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/strong&gt; the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
