&lt;li&gt;オペレーション組織1→100拡大の経験を得たい方&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;福利厚生&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;査定（年2回）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ボーナス（年1回）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;通勤交通費&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;完全週休二日（土日祝）、年末年始休み&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;有給休日&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;慶長休暇、産休、育休&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;社会保険：労災保険、雇用保険、健康保険、厚生年金完備&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;就業時間：10:00-19:00（休憩1時間を含む）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;オフィス：六本木ヒルズ&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

mbaexchange-adasia:greenhouse:7694106.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h2&gt;We are seeking a results-oriented professional Junior / Senior Executive, E-commerce Key Account Management (KAM) to be responsible for planning, executing, and overseeing campaigns and events, ensuring alignment with clients’ marketing goals.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee daily operations of Lazada, Shopee, and TikTok stores, ensuring product listings are accurate, up-to-date, and optimized for search.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage inventory levels across platforms and coordinate with supply chain teams to prevent stockouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, manage, and execute marketing campaigns, events (e.g., mega sales like 3.3/9.9/11.11/12.12, product launches, collaborations), promotions, and discount strategies tailored for each platform (Lazada, Shopee, TikTok) to drive traffic, sales, and meet client/brand goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project timelines and coordinate promotional activities, including live streaming events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, manage, and utilize platform-specific advertising tools (including in-app ads) to drive traffic and conversions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve individual monthly sales targets consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, analyze, and report on sales performance and campaign effectiveness, providing actionable insights and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary liaison for clients (if applicable), internal teams (design, brand marketing, supply chain), and third-party vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong client relationships (if applicable) and ensure alignment of marketing efforts with the overall brand strategy through constant communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with design teams to create engaging and effective visual content for platforms and campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate all logistics for campaign execution, working with internal departments and external vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage resources effectively to ensure work is completed within budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work extended hours or during nights as needed to monitor and support mega campaigns (e.g., 3.3, 9.9, 11.11, 12.12).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing or related field, with 1-3 years of relevant Marketing/Agency experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of e-commerce platforms, proficient in data analysis and performance metrics, with advanced Excel skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English communication (written &amp;amp; spoken) and strong collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative and strategic thinker with strong problem-solving abilities and a customer-centric approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, detail-oriented, and proactive with proven ability to multitask and prioritize effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented and target-driven, demonstrating the ability to work independently and take initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced AI tools for all positions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Bonus (1 time per year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual leaves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TGIF, monthly birthday and other fun engagement events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a professional and dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exciting opportunity to explore digital trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

mbaexchange-adasia:greenhouse:7870128.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h2&gt;We’re looking for an Executive / Senior Executive, Brand Strategist who plays an active role in turning client briefs into strong, insight-driven campaign strategies. You’ll be responsible for uncovering insights, shaping strategic directions, and translating them into clear, compelling narratives across proposals and campaigns. This role is ideal for someone who is curious, analytical, and able to move beyond execution to contribute meaningful strategic perspectives.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Research &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct and interpret research across brands, competitors, audiences, and industry trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate data and observations into clear, actionable insights and strategic opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage social listening, platform data, and cultural trends to inform planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse campaign performance and extract key learnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for optimisation and improvement in strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Strategy, Proposal &amp;amp; Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop campaign strategies, key messaging, and creative directions based on briefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business objectives and insights into clear strategic frameworks and ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute ideas and perspectives during brainstorming and planning sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft compelling pitch decks with strong storytelling and logical flow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clarity and consistency of messaging across strategy and proposal materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal and client presentations, with opportunities to contribute to presenting strategic thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Account Managers to understand client requirements and feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Ops to ensure proposals reflect realistic timelines, deliverables, and costings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reaching out to cross-functional specialist teams (e.g. POKKT, XHS, affiliate, livestream and etc) to integrate their plans into the cohesive strategy&lt;/li&gt;
